 may end the engagement subject to active project obligations and applicable law."}]'::jsonb,'[{"key":"independent_contractor","label":"I understand this is a project-based independent contractor arrangement and not a guaranteed salaried position."},{"key":"quality_sop","label":"I agree to follow ProFox content SOPs, evidence standards, review and handoff requirements."},{"key":"confidentiality","label":"I agree to protect ProFox and client confidential information and data."},{"key":"truth_originality","label":"I will not fabricate claims, plagiarize, or misrepresent authorship, research or results."}]'::jsonb,'content_writer','content_writer',now()
