('content_recruitment_portfolio_submitted','Content Creator portfolio submitted','Your ProFox Portfolio Review has been submitted','Hi {{candidateName}},\n\nWe have received your structured Content Creator portfolio submission. It is now read-only and queued for review.\n\nRegards,\nProFox Recruitment Team',null,true,'Candidate confirmation after Content Creator portfolio submission.'),
